OL,3,ADebt advice that may leave you owing
OL,4,Aeven more money
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn increasing number of people are
OL,7,Fmissing credit card repayments as
OL,8,Ffinances are stretched by rising bills.
OL,10,FLenders have told the Bank of England
OL,11,Fthey expect the number of unpaid credit
OL,12,Fcard debts to keep going up this
OL,13,Fautumn.
OL,15,FThis could lead to more demand for
OL,16,Fadvice on how to deal with debts ` but,
OL,17,Fif you are struggling and need help,
OL,18,Fthere are some traps to avoid.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
